  "steps": [
    "Wash quinoa + both dals well. Add to pressure cooker with water. Cook for 3 whistles until soft and khichdi-like.",
    "Heat ghee in a pan.",
    "Add jeera → green chillies → ginger-garlic paste.",
    "Add chopped onions + tomato paste.",
    "Sauté 5-6 minutes.",
    "Add chopped leaves + khichdi.",
    "Mix well and simmer 5 mins to thicken.",
    "Add masalas and cook for another 5 minutes. Adjust consistency with water.",
    "Finish with lemon juice."
  ],
